As $\exp$ is [[Definition:Strictly Increasing Real Function|strictly increasing]], exponentiating both sides gives:
:$\displaystyle \frac 1 n \sum_{i \mathop = 1}^n x_i \ge \paren {\prod_{i \mathop = 1}^n x_i}^{1 / n}$
{{qed}}
